            "review_title": "Review at Secret Garden",
            "review_text": "Anil T\nMumbai, India1216 contributions\n0\nFood was amazing\nDec 2018 • Friends\nLovely place to sit four floors up, calm and breezy and in the evenings very pretty. The food is average, similar to what you might find 4 floors down at street level but with better garnish. Service was a little slow and lack luster but I went towards the end of lunch, was also slow the time before in the evening although this was a busy period! So slow service and not particularly friendly or knowledgeable about the food. \nOverall tasty food in lovely breezy surroundings, although better can be found!\nWould only recommend for the food.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 11, 2019",
