            "review_text": "Sonia W\nDuncraig, Australia38 contributions\n0\nAvoid! Rip off rude staff\nOct 2018 • Friends\nWe were a group of 17 people and they told us they would book us taxis to a pool party, we had to pay for taxis on arrival and the staff ripped us off! 100k to get in and the water was 20,000dong we gave 100,000 and No change. when we bought it up with management they brushed it off. flipside manager Eoin failed our whole group in recommending this bar which is also 20 minutes in the middle of nowhere! very misleading and rude staff! Do not go to secret garden pool party or stay at flipside hostel. Eoin was also there while we disputed our service and he done absolutely nothing to rectify this! even though he was the one who made us go here in the first place. it's not just one person's opinion all 17 of us left! Flipside staff obviously have some kind of agreement to take tour groups there! horrendous experience!\nRead more\nWritten October 27, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
