            "review_text": "Parker\nLos Angeles, California268 contributions\n0\nFantastic live music\nOct 2017 • Solo\nSuch a nice place. Hard to find, entrance is a kiosk under the Landmark 72 building. Totally worth finding. If you are staying in the Intercontinental it’s in your basement. Nice drinks, tri lingual staff, Vietnamese, English, Korean. \n\nRelaxed environment, nice quiet drinks with cool live music.\nRead more\nWritten October 6, 2017",
