            "reviewer_id": "User_p1_6",
            "review_title": "Review at Secret Garden",
            "review_text": "mirandaluise\nOcean Shores, Australia28 contributions\n0\nMagical\nMay 2017\nOur first night in Hoi An & we wandered into the Old Town looking for the Secret Garden Restaurant we had been told about. Down an alley way we found this magical place. It was like walking into a hidden gem & the food is incredible. Being a vegetarian I have struggled finding food to tickle my taste buds & I was certainly not disappointed. We sat & watched one of the chefs as she made the rice paper to then make the beautiful & delicate spring rolls. We loved The Sexret Garden so much we went again the next night.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 15, 2017",
